conn_bt|Bluetooth|Bluetooth|Bluetooth|Bluetooth|Bluetooth|Bluetooth|Bluetooth|Bluetooth
conn_wifi|Wi-Fi|Wi-Fi|WLAN|Wi-Fi|Wi-Fi|Wifi|Wi-Fi|Wi-Fi
conn_hotspot|Hotspot|Point d'accès|Hotspot|Punto de acceso|Hotspot|Hotspot|Erişim noktası|Hotspot
